://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230328901468"},{"id":"D32","kind":"DART 공시","title":"매출액또는손익구조30%(대규모법인은15%)이상변동","date":"2023-02-22","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20230222900840"},{"id":"R","kind":"DART 사업보고서","title":"사업보고서 (2024.12) 'II. 사업의 내용'","date":"2025-03-18","url":"https://dart.fss.or.kr/dsaf001/main.do?rcpNo=20250318000946"}]}